.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"leiomano","_migration":{"version":0.959,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.955,"foundry":"14.363","system":"8.1.2"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fatal-d10","versatile-s"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Treasure Vault (Remastered)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":0},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"leiomano","bulk":{"value":1},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":2},"sizeSensitive":false},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"containerId":null,"size":"lg","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"","img":"","data":{"description":{"value":""}}}},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"club","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"bludgeoning","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":null,"expend":null,"ammo":null,"reload":{"value":null},"grade":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"specific":null,"subitems":[],"bonusDamage":{"value":0}},"type":"weapon","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.27CO2NIr5yMgA6sa","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","createdTime":1780421721561,"modifiedTime":1780421974660,"lastModifiedBy":"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_id":"B2YsYYJ3HCYlypNU","ownership":{"default":0}},{"img":"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/bazaar/core/icons/containers/bags/pack-leather-tan.webp","name":"War Saddle","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Each war saddle is specifically fitted to a mount's body type and has numerous straps that can secure you on your mount. You remain mounted even if you fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} until either you or someone else uses an Interact action to unfasten the straps on the saddle. A creature or effect can separate you from your mount by pulling so hard it tears the straps, but to do so, the effect's DC, attack roll, or skill check must exceed 20.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"war-saddle","_migration":{"version":0.959,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.955,"foundry":"14.363","system":"8.1.2"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Battlecry!","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"quantity":1,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":1},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":50},"sizeSensitive":false},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"containerId":null,"size":"lg","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"","img":"","data":{"description":{"value":""}}}},"usage":{"value":"other"},"subitems":[]},"type":"equipment","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.mdNNIF01ybgs1m3s","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","createdTime":1780421721561,"modifiedTime":1780421721561,"lastModifiedBy":"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_id":"jDarCCKAg6sARWLz","ownership":{"default":0}},{"img":"icons/sundries/survival/cuffs-shackles-steel.webp","name":"Manacles (Simple)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You can manacle someone who is willing or otherwise at your mercy as an exploration activity taking 10-30 seconds depending on the creature's size and how many manacles you apply. A two-legged creature with its legs bound takes a –15-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds, and a two-handed creature with its wrists bound has to succeed at a @Check[flat|dc:5] any time it uses a manipulate action or else that action fails. This DC may be higher depending on how tightly the manacles constrain the hands. A creature bound to a stationary object is immobilized. For creatures with more or fewer limbs, the GM determines what effect manacles have, if any. Freeing a creature from simple manacles requires three successful @Check[thievery|dc:22|traits:action:pick-a-lock] checks.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"manacles-simple","_migration":{"version":0.959,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"quantity":3,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":3},"sizeSensitive":false},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"containerId":"xqCTxbbPgHjpwGmf","size":"lg","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"","img":"","data":{"description":{"value":""}}}},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"subitems":[]},"type":"equipment","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ckGYDocGEaelHfXF","createdTime":1780421789370,"modifiedTime":1780421925640,"lastModifiedBy":"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":75000,"ownership":{"default":0,"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO":3},"flags":{"scene-packer":{"hash":"90962944b74201f1f95cd84fdb00e9d4d15803a4"}},"_id":"LXPIaY77KnXCigGH"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/specific-magic-weapons/blast-lance.webp","name":"Blast Lance","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>This weapon is a long <em>+1 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.OPMzQdM9rZznMGhW]{Lance}</em> with a muzzle built into the pointed tip, allowing the user to fire the chamber after a successful melee attack. A barrel running down the length of the lance allows you to load firearm ammunition into the base of the weapon more easily than it might seem from the design. It takes 2 actions to reload a <em>blast lance</em>.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> command</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You strike a foe with the <em>blast lance</em></p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The <em>blast lance</em> is loaded with a round</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You fire a blast of gunpowder through the weapon that deals @Damage[2d8[fire]] damage. The foe must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:18] save.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected by the blast of gunpowder and the <em>blast lance</em> misfires and jams.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half the fire damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes the full fire damage and is pushed back 5 feet. You can Stride after it, but you must move the same distance and in the same direction.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and is pushed back 10 feet. You can Stride after it, but you must move the same distance and in the same direction.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"blast-lance","_migration":{"version":0.959,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.955,"foundry":"14.363","system":"8.1.2"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["deadly-d8","fire","jousting-d6","magical","reach"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder #180: The Smoking Gun","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"quantity":1,"baseItem":"lance","bulk":{"value":2},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"containerId":"xqCTxbbPgHjpwGmf","size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"","img":"","data":{"description":{"value":""}}}},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"simple","group":"spear","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":null,"expend":null,"ammo":null,"reload":{"value":null},"grade":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"striking":0,"property":[]},"specific":{"material":{"base":[{"thickness":"thin","type":"steel"}],"grade":null,"type":null},"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":0}},"subitems":[],"bonusDamage":{"value":0}},"type":"weapon","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qLhb5ZvIDOmbwvc9","duplicateSource":"Actor.GMbqOp4tO8tNOiuH.Item.mUgVTyGrhOju6fgo","exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","createdTime":1780421955270,"modifiedTime":1780421955270,"lastModifiedBy":"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"scene-packer":{"hash":"d423780ac3d47338fa089112ef0cde9f56425710"}},"_id":"SyfPDYZy1uL9ZWoY","ownership":{"default":0,"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO":3}},{"folder":"0Z6sKp3ActW2pM2e","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Squeeze","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>You contort yourself to [[/act squeeze]]{squeeze} through a space so small you can barely fit through. This action is for exceptionally small spaces; many tight spaces are difficult terrain that you can move through more quickly and without a check.</p><hr><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You squeeze through the tight space in 1 minute per 10 feet of squeezing.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You squeeze through in 1 minute per 5 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You become stuck in the tight space. While you're stuck, you can spend 1 minute attempting another Acrobatics check at the same DC. Any result on that check other than a critical failure causes you to become unstuck.</p><h2 class=\"title\">Sample Squeeze Tasks</h2><ul><li><strong>Trained</strong> space barely fitting your shoulders</li><li><strong>Master</strong> space barely fitting your head</li></ul>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":["exploration","move"],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"squeeze","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.kMcV8e5EZUxa6evt","createdTime":1780428146758,"modifiedTime":1780428146758,"lastModifiedBy":"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO":3},"flags":{"scene-packer":{"hash":"1338bff387b01b8bb242d8cc351c61297b90faa6"}},"_id":"zcMRX7oaHdKaQu46"}],"folder":null,"flags":{"pf2e":{"showBasicUnarmed":true,"sheetTabs":{"pfs":false,"biography":false,"crafting":false,"spellcasting":false},"dailyCraftingComplete":false},"scene-packer":{"sourceId":"Actor.vuUpMc9KpAbJsfvH","defaultPermission":1},"pf2e-dailies":{"rested":true}},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.the-moonlit-march-module.actors.Actor.BKeDWY7vhSnUf7Qe","duplicateSource":"Actor.f5bGnTlUt8OGmXuJ","exportSource":{"worldId":"test","uuid":"Actor.uy3UQngTrgkwhlNC","coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.10.1"},"coreVersion":"14.363","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.1.2","createdTime":1780421721561,"modifiedTime":1780438853170,"lastModifiedBy":"TWU0FLEEJw1nn2KO"},"_id":"f5bGnTlUt8OGmXuJ","sort":-100000}